  "Bilingual: English root + Traditional Chinese under /zh.": "Gagana e Lua: Fa'a-Peretania fa'aaogaina + Fa'a-Saina Masani i lalo o le /zh.",
  "Bounded agentic payment: budgets, approvals, audit trails": "Totogi a Sui Fa'atapula'aina: tupe fa'atagaina, fa'amaoniga, ala iloiloga",
